For Determine if any subset of [3, 34, 4, 12, 5, 2] sums to 9. I will iterate items and update reachable sums.

```python
def subset_sum(xs, target):
    dp = [False] * (target + 1)
    dp[0] = True
    for x in xs:
        for s in range(target, x - 1, -1):
            if dp[s - x]:
                dp[s] = True
    return dp[target]
```

